# Mira Sykes, Faust's bodyguard (faction faust, carries mansion_key and faust_safe_key).
# She turns hostile on her own when she sees Faust attacked (crime system); here she only warns.

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('Killed(logan_faust)')
goto: FaustDead

cond: HasFlag('faust_allied')
goto: Allied

cond: HasFlag('faust_extorted')
goto: Extorted

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (Her hand never leaves the holster.)
+ That's close enough. What do you want with Mr. Faust?
#
o_text: Just to talk. Nobody has to get hurt.
o_id: just_talk
o_goto: JustTalk
#
o_text: What's a bodyguard doing in a dead man's house?
o_id: dead_man
o_goto: Warning
#
o_text: Step aside, or you go down first.
o_id: intimidate_mira
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Hard')
o_succ: BacksDown
o_fail: Fight
#
o_text: Nothing. Leaving.
o_id: mira_leave
o_goto: End
#
o_text: <Attack>
o_id: attack_mira
o_goto: Fight

name: JustTalk
npc: Then talk fast and keep your hands where I can see them.
+ He's in the study. I'll be right behind you.
#
o_text: Fair enough.
o_id: fair_enough
o_goto: End

name: Warning
npc: He isn't dead. Not while I'm standing.
+ E. already sent two of your kind. They're in the compost behind the greenhouse.
+ Whatever they're paying you, it won't cover the burial.
#
o_text: Noted.
o_id: warning_noted
o_goto: Default

name: BacksDown
npc: (Her jaw works.) I'm paid to die for him, not to die stupid.
+ Study. End of the hall. If he screams, I come in shooting.
effect: SetFlag('mira_backed_down')
#
o_text: Wise.
o_id: mira_wise
o_goto: End

name: Allied
npc: He trusts you. I don't. But he's the one paying me.
#
o_text: How long have you been with him?
o_id: how_long
o_goto: HowLong
#
o_text: Nothing.
o_id: allied_leave
o_goto: End

name: HowLong
npc: Since the board meeting he walked out of. Six years.
+ He pays on time and he never once asked me to hurt anyone. Rare, in this town.
#
o_text: Rare indeed.
o_id: rare_indeed
o_goto: End

name: Extorted
npc: You robbed a frightened old man. Enjoy it.
+ Next time you come through that door I shoot first.
#
o_text: Noted.
o_id: extorted_leave
o_goto: End
#
o_text: <Attack>
o_id: attack_mira_extorted
o_goto: Fight

name: FaustDead
npc: (Her eyes are red. The gun is steady.)
+ You did this. Or you let it happen. Same thing.
#
o_text: I'm sorry.
o_id: sorry
o_goto: Sorry
#
o_text: <Attack>
o_id: attack_mira_grieving
o_goto: Fight

name: Sorry
npc: Sorry doesn't warm a corpse. Get out.
#
o_text: (Leave.)
o_id: sorry_leave
o_goto: End

name: Fight
npc: Wrong move.
effect: StartCombat

name: End
npc: (She watches you all the way to the door.)
effect: EndConversation
